{
  "slug": "status-quote",
  "name": "Status Quote",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Status Quote allows you to customise your Claude Code status spinner with quotes and phrases from your favourite franchises, movies, TV shows, or individual characters. Break away from the default spinner status quo...with Status Quote",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `create` (Generate a custom quote pack for any movie, TV show, or character), `list` (List all available quote packs, groups, aliases, and show the currently active selection), `mix` (Alias for /statusquote:use), `reset` (Reset the Claude Code spinner to its default words, removing all franchise quotes), `style` (Set quote style for the spinner - verbs only, phrases only, or mix of both), `use` (Apply quote packs to the Claude Code spinner)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install status-quote@claude-community` from `FurbySoup/status-quote`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
